# Force LF line endings for the Rust crate, regardless of a contributor's
# local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows checkout (autocrlf=true)
# smudges these files to CRLF on disk; tool/prebuilt_common.dart's
# computeSourceHash() hashes raw file bytes, so a MANIFEST.json generated from
# a CRLF working tree records a sourceHash that a Linux CI checkout (LF, no
# conversion) can never reproduce — every prebuilt-sync check then fails with
# a spurious "Rust sources changed" error, even when nothing actually did.
#
# 强制 rust/ crate 使用 LF 换行符，不受贡献者本地 core.autocrlf 设置影响。没有
# 这条规则时，Windows 检出（autocrlf=true）会把这些文件在磁盘上转成 CRLF；
# tool/prebuilt_common.dart 的 computeSourceHash() 是按原始字节哈希的，用 CRLF
# 工作区生成的 MANIFEST.json 记录的 sourceHash，Linux CI 检出（LF，不转换）永远
# 复现不出来——结果是每次 prebuilt-sync 校验都会假报"Rust 源码变了"，即便实际
# 什么都没变。
rust/**/*.rs text eol=lf
rust/**/Cargo.toml text eol=lf
rust/**/Cargo.lock text eol=lf

# The vendored Apple bundles are build products, not source. Their `Info.plist`
# files are the only text-shaped entries in them, and prebuilt/MANIFEST.json
# hashes raw bytes — so a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would smudge
# them to CRLF and make every prebuilt-sync check fail on that machine. Marking
# the whole bundle `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion.
#
# 两个 Apple vendored bundle 是构建产物而非源码。里面唯一像文本的就是 `Info.plist`，
# 而 prebuilt/MANIFEST.json 按原始字节哈希——Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 的检出会把
# 它们转成 CRLF，导致该机器上每次 prebuilt-sync 校验都失败。整个 bundle 标记 `-text`
# 即可关闭全部换行符转换。
ios/svgx.xcframework/** -text
macos/svgx.framework/** -text
